          },
          "description": "A collection of original audio stories for those days when it is too wet for outdoor adventures. Especially written for little dreamers and young explorers who never let the weather get in the way of their next adventure. This edition is filled with creative and engaging sound effects and is the perfect wet weather companion for little listeners everywhere. Narrated by Michael Obiora and Pearl Mackie, best known for her portrayal of Bill in Doctor Who.",
